{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11109200","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11109200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1110920001:0":{"text":"Ladies and gentlemen, are you looking for information about the Quicksand Claws? I have something for you, but keep it down.","source_cn":"几位老爷小姐，你们是要打听流沙之爪的消息？悄悄地说，我知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B8F92806C7E6546","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110920002:0":{"text":"This kind of information usually goes for two handfuls of gold. Today I'm asking for only ten pieces of gold. Think about it!","source_cn":"原本要两只爪子能拿下的金币才能透露，现在只要十个金币，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x652C04ACCC76DEF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1110920002":{"text":"This kind of information usually goes for two handfuls of gold. Today I'm asking for only ten pieces of gold. Think about it!","source_cn":"原本要两只爪子能拿下的金币才能透露，现在只要十个金币，你们考虑考虑？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x652C04ACCC76DEF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110920003:0":{"text":"A few dozen words for ten pieces of gold. What a... generous... offer.","source_cn":"一条情报，不过几十个字，就要十个金币。你还真是童叟无欺...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E0F3335BA445EE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1110920003":{"text":"A few dozen words for ten pieces of gold. What a... generous... offer.","source_cn":"一条情报，不过几十个字，就要十个金币。你还真是童叟无欺的大善人呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E0F3335BA445EE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110920004:1":{"text":"A diviner? Ah... Did she talk with you about fate, the movement of stars, and the direction of the sun?","source_cn":"占卜师？啊……占卜师是不是和你们说了气运？星星的转动？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC715468977847A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110920005:1":{"text":"I can do that as well. Today, the third star in the Scorpion palace is dull and faint. Those born at 3 a.m. are doomed to misfortune. How do I sound?","source_cn":"那一套话术我也会，“今天毒蝎座的第三颗星颜色黯淡，早上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x328DA0D656F7947D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110920006:1":{"text":"Since fate has brought us together today, I'm willing to lower the price to 8 pieces of gold. Final offer!","source_cn":"我想，咱们今天相遇也是缘分，我愿意做个好人。八枚金币，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BE4299F1943CC6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110920007:0":{"text":"Let's go.","source_cn":"我们走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x537C4CDCD3BAAB33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110920008:0":{"text":"How about... I'll take 6 pieces of gold and no less! ...How about 5? 4?","source_cn":"——小哥！\\n老、老爷！六枚，真不能再低了！要不五枚？四枚？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12617C5FC1CB9221","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110920009:0":{"text":"You don't have what we want.","source_cn":"你没有情报。摆在明面上的，只会是诱饵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30039E900DF11790","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110920010:0":{"text":"I do! And I know you and I will be best friends in no time.","source_cn":"不不，情报还是有的，只是我今天和老爷小姐们特别投缘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x882119426AD9074B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110920011:0":{"text":"Here! Take a look at these fabulous bone products I have. Look! This bugle is made out of the severed horn of an ironjaw. And this bracelet is made with the clawtips of terrabirds...","source_cn":"再不然，您几位看看我这摊子上的骨制品，也是极好的！请看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10038CA081860FC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110920012:0":{"text":"Hang on a minute... Wolf fang collar, ivory pendant...","source_cn":"等等……狼牙项圈、象牙挂坠……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D2F1089D1C4BF2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110920013:0":{"text":"He sells bone accessories!","source_cn":"他的商品全是骨制饰品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBB4AF43045100F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1110920013":{"text":"He sells bone accessories!","source_cn":"他的商品全是骨制饰品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBB4AF43045100F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110920014:0":{"text":"She said it had wolf fangs and a large piece of Prism Ignis... Do you think this guy has it?","source_cn":"我记得她说，项链上有狼的牙齿，还有一大块炎晶石……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E13C4974B765576","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1110920015:0":{"text":"You've got a very good taste! Most places out here won't have good quality necklaces.","source_cn":"喔，老板小姐们，真是有品位。你们要的都是稀罕东西，一般...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB408EE04DC966E55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110920016:0":{"text":"But I do! Lucky you!","source_cn":"但是、但是！你们来得很巧，我这里新进了货。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E0A74FFC87539B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:26::1":{"text":"Elegant Necklace","source_cn":"精致的兽牙项链","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB5EFF1D91A97810","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110920017:2":{"text":"Have a look! How pure this Prism Ignis is! And the fangs of a wild wolf! This is perfect for your needs!","source_cn":"请看，洁净度极高的炎晶石，荒原狼的上犬齿——完美符合您...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF712C9C49319EB59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110920018:0":{"text":"I paid a fortune for it. I'm selling it for... only 10 pieces of gold. What do you say?","source_cn":"这是我花大价钱搞到的，售价么……我想，还是十枚金币，怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x041895DA81E73BB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1110920019:0":{"text":"It looks just like the necklace Satrana has described!","source_cn":"的确和萨忒娜描述的项链长得一模一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x135AD98379897A7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1110920020:1":{"text":"And this seller has blonde-ish fur...","source_cn":"而且这位老板，也长着橙红色的皮毛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C9E092B71416810","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1110920021:0":{"text":"Come on, don't pull a poker face at me. If you don't like the price, we can negotiate a bit.","source_cn":"几位，不要板着脸嘛。不满意价格的话，要不我再降降价？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AFB8433D958B0CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1110920022:0":{"text":"Enough. This is not yours.","source_cn":"够了。那是别人的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FF026A310EE2F74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1110920023:0":{"text":"Hand over what you stole.","source_cn":"把你偷的项链交出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC87966EBA5561647","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1110920024:0":{"text":"Huh?!","source_cn":"诶？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E1D053063F2FCE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:0:1":{"text":"What was Satrana's necklace like?","source_cn":"萨忒娜找的项链长什么样来着？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD25C393B489F28B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What was Satrana's necklace like?","female":"What was Satrana's necklace like?","variant_male_record_index":"63560","variant_female_record_index":"63561","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:1:2":{"text":"I'm looking for a necklace.","source_cn":"我想要缀着炎晶石的项链","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6BC7561EFC42AE14","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm looking for a necklace.","female":"I'm looking for a necklace.","variant_male_record_index":"63562","variant_female_record_index":"63563","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"No need. We know a diviner.","source_cn":"我们认识占卜师，不需要","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x93DCCCD51F39E714","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"No need. We know a diviner.","female":"No need. We know a diviner.","variant_male_record_index":"63558","variant_female_record_index":"63559","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"I'm a mage, tell me for free.","source_cn":"我是魔法师，免费告诉我","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x192EDE4B65EE362C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm a mage, tell me for free.","female":"I'm a mage, tell me for free.","variant_male_record_index":"63554","variant_female_record_index":"63555","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"Wow...","source_cn":"哇，真是大优惠！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64"